  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Yelchuri Venkaiah, vs State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 24 August, 2020 Author: D.Ramesh Bench: D.Ramesh The Honourable Sri Justice D.Ramesh Criminal Petition No.3324 of 2020 O R D E R:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioner/A1 under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 seeking to quash entire proceedings in Crime No.273 of 2020 on the file of Kavali Rural Police Station, Kavali, Nellore District. The offences alleged are under Sections 272, 273, 328 of IPC and Section 59(1) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "3. Learned counsel for the petitioner so also the learned Additional Public Prosecutor would submit that the issue involved in the present case is squarely covered by the common order, dated 27.08.2018, of this Court in Criminal Petition No.3731 of 2018 and batch wherein Criminal Petition No.6754 of 2018 was allowed.",
